{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36904","headline":"寄程尊师 · 罗隐","name":"寄程尊师","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"鹤信虽然到五湖，烟波迢遰路崎岖。\n玉书分薄花生眼，金鼎功迟雪满须。\n三秀紫芝劳梦寐，一番红槿恨朝晡。\n未知朽败凡间骨，中授先生指教无。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36904.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36904","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}